    - target: {fileID: 7171377577227371525, guid: 0fe78255669ecdf458fdf468d9d05a4f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Certain jobs and actions may attract <b><color=#FF5555>police attention</b></color>.\n\nAs
        your <color=#FF5555>Wanted Level</color> rises, more police ships may join
        the pursuit. Their <color=#FF5555>tractor beams</color> can slow your ship
        down and make escaping increasingly difficult.\n\nBreak contact with the
        police and stay out of sight long enough to clear the chase.\n\n\n<size=85%><color=#20843E>Higher
        risk can mean greater rewards \u2014 but you still need to make it to the
        destination, and with the package intact.</size></color>"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7171377577227371525, guid: 0fe78255669ecdf458fdf468d9d05a4f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_fontColor.b
